# event4u-agent Pricing Book signing key (Ed25519, SPKI/PEM).
#
# T-1401: the plugin verifies a candidate `prices.yml` against THIS public key
# before trusting an over-the-wire pricing update. The matching PRIVATE key is
# never committed — it is held by the release signing pipeline (T-1402, GitHub
# Actions + Sigstore/SLSA). Until that pipeline lands, no signed feed exists, so
# `resolvePricing` fails open to the plugin-bundled baseline `prices.yml`.
#
# Replace this development placeholder with the real release key when T-1402
# ships. Lines before the PEM block are ignored by the parser.
